OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,FThe chief executive of the Law Society
OL,7,Fof Northern Ireland has been urged to
OL,8,Fresign after providing a character
OL,9,Freference for a man convicted of
OL,10,Fhistorical sexual offences.
OL,12,FWilliam Lloyd-Lavery, 77, of Richmond
OL,13,FAvenue in Lisburn, who went on to work
OL,14,Ffor a number of UUP MLAs, was
OL,15,Fsentenced to two years in prison after
OL,16,Fbeing found guilty of six counts of
OL,17,Findecent assault at a school he taught
OL,18,Fat in the 1970s.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
