CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,FDavid Lavery, The Chief Executive of
OL,7,Fthe Law Society in Northern Ireland,
OL,8,Fhas apologised for what he calls a
OL,9,F"serious error in judgement" in a
OL,10,Fstatement to the Belfast Telegraph.
OL,12,FIt comes days after the Secretary of
OL,13,FState took the decision to remove him
OL,14,Ffrom his other role as Human Rights
OL,15,FCommissioner after the investigation
OL,16,Finto his character reference for his
OL,17,Fconvicted paedophile cousin.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,FFormer Ulster Unionist Party chairman
OL,7,FDavid Campbell also provided a good
OL,8,Fcharacter reference for Lloyd-Lavery,
OL,9,Fwhich sparked questions over the
OL,10,Fpractice.
OL,12,FLaw Society president Mark Borland
OL,13,Fsaid in a statement that he is "deeply
OL,14,Fsorry if the society has in any way
OL,15,Fcompounded their pain", adding it has
OL,16,Fconducted an internal process.
OL,18,FJustice Committee Chair Paul Frew says
OL,19,Fthe Law Society in Northern Ireland
OL,20,Fneeds to be "open and transparent".
OL,26,@uD@`OUwD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,FHe said: "Because the Sectretary of
OL,7,FState has made such swift action, they
OL,8,Fcould have allowed David to retire in
OL,9,Fthe next month but they've actually
OL,10,Fremoved him.
OL,12,F"I think the Law Society have a lot to
OL,13,Fanswer for, he did come to the justice
OL,14,Fcommittee on the 2nd of July, he did
OL,15,Ftell us at that stage that they were
OL,16,Fgoing through a process. But to keep
OL,17,Fthat process quiet I think it's wrong.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,F"I think they need to come forward, be
OL,7,Fopen and transparent with the
OL,8,Fprocesses conducted and their
OL,9,Fconclusions and then to justify their
OL,10,Fconclusions."
OL,12,FIn response to the calls President of
OL,13,Fthe Law Society of Northern Ireland
OL,14,FMark Borland said: "I listened to
OL,15,FNicola Bannon this morning and her
OL,16,Fpowerful testimony about how she feels
OL,17,Fas a victim.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,F"I profoundly regret the distress and
OL,7,Ftrauma that this has caused for her
OL,8,Fand for the other victims of William
OL,9,FLloyd Lavery. I am deeply sorry if the
OL,10,FSociety has in any way compounded
OL,11,Ftheir pain.
OL,13,F"The Law Society has conducted an
OL,14,Finternal process and for reasons of
OL,15,Fconfidentiality, we are limited in
OL,16,Fwhat we can say publicly.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,F"I know that will be disappointing but
OL,7,FI want to assure Nicola and other
OL,8,Fvictims that we hear them, we are
OL,9,Flistening to their concerns and
OL,10,Fexperiences and we are committed to
OL,11,Fensuring that their voice is heard in
OL,12,Fthe public debate about the use of
OL,13,Fcharacter references following
OL,14,Fconviction.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
