OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,F"We will take steps immediately to
OL,7,Fconvene that discussion with our
OL,8,Fmembers and we will seek to include
OL,9,Fthe voices of victims and survivors
OL,10,Fincluding, if they felt appropriate,
OL,11,Fthe victims in this case. We recognise
OL,12,Fthe impact these matters have had and
OL,13,Fwe are committed to doing all we can
OL,14,Fto support the victims in any way
OL,15,Fpossible."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
