PN,41509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,FAfter David Lavery was removed from
OL,7,Fhis position as the Human Rights
OL,8,FCommissioner, a spokesperson for the
OL,9,Fbody said: "The protection of victims
OL,10,Fof sexual violence and abuse is of the
OL,11,Futmost importance to the Northern
OL,12,FIreland Human Rights Commission.
OL,14,F"Following media reports that
OL,15,FCommissioner David Lavery had given a
OL,16,Freference to a relative convicted of
OL,17,Fhistorical and serious sexual
OL,18,Foffences, we initiated an independent
OL,19,Finvestigation under the Commission's
OL,20,FCode of Governance.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,F"That investigation is now complete.
OL,8,F"After receipt of the investigation
OL,9,Freport the Secretary of State has
OL,10,Fexercised his statutory powers and
OL,11,Fremoved David Lavery from his post as
OL,12,FCommissioner of the Northern Ireland
OL,13,FHuman Rights Commission with immediate
OL,14,Feffect."
OL,16,FA Northern Ireland Office spokesperson
OL,17,Fsaid: "The public rightly expects the
OL,18,Fhighest standards of integrity and
OL,19,Fprofessionalism from those in public
OL,20,Fappointments.
OL,26,@yD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,F"An investigation and an independent
OL,7,Freview were initiated by the NI Human
OL,8,FRights Commission (NIHRC) after public
OL,9,Freports revealed that its
OL,10,FCommissioner, David Lavery, had given
OL,11,Fa reference to a relative convicted of
OL,12,Fhistorical and serious sexual offences.
OL,14,F"This independent review concluded
OL,15,Fthat in providing this reference, Mr
OL,16,FLavery had breached the NIHRC Code of
OL,17,FGovernance and was capable of bringing
OL,18,Fthe Commission into disrepute and
OL,19,Fdemonstrated a severe failure of
OL,20,Fjudgment regarding public office
OL,21,Fresponsibilities.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/12
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786025912
OL,3,CLaw Society NI Chief under fire over
OL,4,Cpaedophile character reference
OL,6,F"Having considered the findings of
OL,7,Fthis independent review, the Secretary
OL,8,Fof State as the appointing Minister
OL,9,Fhas terminated Mr Lavery's appointment
OL,10,Fwith immediate effect."
